  "body": "Large Flat 683m2 THAB Zoned Freehold Site, with Huge Potential, and “Free” Fully Renovated 4 Bedroom 2 bathroom home thrown in…\r\n\r\nThe Potential…\r\n\r\n-Terraced Housing and Apartment zoning. Non-notified consent for 3 dwellings as of right, with 50% site coverage, up to 5 stories, unlimited density zoning.\r\n\r\n-Live in this Move In Ready Property today, renovate to your taste, extend for larger families, or add a pool.\r\n\r\n-Rent and Land Bank the Future Development Potential. Current market rental return is $1,400 per week.\r\n\r\n-Subdivide and Build Your New Dream Home, Sell off the Original House and Bank the Profit, or Redevelop 2 Large Houses and start again. \r\n\r\n-Add a Second or Third Dwelling as of right for extended family or additional income.\r\n\r\n-This Site will fit 5 terraced houses, or 4 stand alone houses, \r\n\r\nThe House...\r\n\r\nEnjoy this Warm North Facing Home with 4 Large Double Bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, on a Substantial, Flat, Fully Fenced section. Freshly Renovated and Painted, Reinsulated and Rewired. 300m from Milford Shops, beside Lake Pupuke and Milford Primary School. Move in ready today!\r\n\r\nA Classic Kiwi Home, made from Native Timber, with Weatherboards and Concrete Tile Roof. Native Timber Polished Floors throughout. Open plan kitchen, dining, and sitting rooms overlook Milford School play grounds. New bathroom with Separate Shower and Bath, new Separate Toilet. Opens out to North Facing Decks and Large Flat Rear Section. Fully Fenced for children, and animals. Large Dry Garage with lots of Off-Street Parking\r\n\r\nViewing by appointment.\t\t\t Price by negotiation\r\n\r\nPhone Now and talk directly to owner: Ph. (09) 486 7799 or (027) 486 7799",
